<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="description" content="<%= post.metaDescription %>">
    <meta name="author" content="RateFlow">
    <meta property="og:title" content="<%= post.metaTitle %>">
    <meta property="og:description" content="<%= post.metaDescription %>">
    <meta property="og:url" content="<%= canonical %>">
    <meta property="og:type" content="article">
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
    <meta name="twitter:title" content="<%= post.metaTitle %>">
    <meta name="twitter:description" content="<%= post.metaDescription %>">
    <link rel="canonical" href="<%= canonical %>">
    <title><%= post.metaTitle %></title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="48x48" href="/favicon-48.png">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/flag-icons/6.6.6/css/flag-icons.min.css">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <script type="application/ld+json">
    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "Article",
      "headline": "<%= post.title %>",
      "description": "<%= post.metaDescription %>",
      "datePublished": "<%= post.date %>",
      "dateModified": "<%= post.date %>",
      "author": {
        "@type": "Organization",
        "name": "RateFlow",
        "url": "https://rateflow.vercel.app/"
      },
      "publisher": {
        "@type": "Organization",
        "name": "RateFlow",
        "url": "https://rateflow.vercel.app/"
      },
      "mainEntityOfPage": {
        "@type": "WebPage",
        "@id": "<%= canonical %>"
      }
    }
    </script>

    <script type="application/ld+json">
    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
      "itemListElement": [
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://rateflow.vercel.app/" },
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Blog", "item": "https://rateflow.vercel.app/blog" },
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "<%= post.title %>", "item": "<%= canonical %>" }
      ]
    }
    </script>

    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #6366f1;
            --primary-dark: #4f46e5;
            --dark: #1e293b;
            --darker: #0f172a;
            --darkest: #020617;
            --light: #f8fafc;
            --gray: #94a3b8;
        }
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background-color: var(--darkest); color: var(--light); min-height: 100vh; line-height: 1.6; }
        .container { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 1.5rem; }
        header { padding: 2rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); }
        .logo { font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--light); text-decoration: none; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; }
        .logo span { color: var(--primary); }
        nav { display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; margin-top: 0.5rem; }
        nav a { color: var(--gray); text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.95rem; transition: color 0.3s; }
        nav a:hover { color: var(--primary); }
        main { padding: 3rem 0; }

        /* Breadcrumb */
        .breadcrumb { display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; align-items: center; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--gray); margin-bottom: 2rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
        .breadcrumb a { color: var(--gray); text-decoration: none; transition: color 0.2s; }
        .breadcrumb a:hover { color: var(--primary); }
        .breadcrumb span { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); }

        .article-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 320px; gap: 3rem; align-items: start; }
        @media (max-width: 900px) { .article-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .sidebar { order: -1; } }

        /* Article */
        article { max-width: 720px; }
        .article-category { display: inline-block; background: rgba(99,102,241,0.15); color: var(--primary); padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
        article h1 { font-size: 2rem; line-height: 1.3; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--light); }
        .article-meta { display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; color: var(--gray); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; padding-bottom: 1.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); flex-wrap: wrap; }
        .article-body { color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.85; }
        .article-body h2 { color: var(--light); font-size: 1.4rem; margin: 2.5rem 0 0.75rem; padding-bottom: 0.5rem; border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(99,102,241,0.3); }
        .article-body h3 { color: var(--light); font-size: 1.15rem; margin: 1.75rem 0 0.5rem; }
        .article-body p { margin-bottom: 1.1rem; }
        .article-body ul, .article-body ol { margin: 0.5rem 0 1.1rem 1.5rem; }
        .article-body li { margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
        .article-body strong { color: var(--light); }
        .article-body table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 1.5rem 0; font-size: 0.9rem; }
        .article-body th { background: rgba(99,102,241,0.2); color: var(--light); padding: 0.75rem; text-align: left; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); }
        .article-body td { padding: 0.75rem; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); }
        .article-body em { color: var(--gray); font-style: italic; }

        /* Sidebar */
        .sidebar { position: sticky; top: 2rem; }
        .sidebar-card { background: var(--darker); border-radius: 1rem; padding: 1.5rem; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
        .sidebar-card h3 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--light); }
        .converter-cta { background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(99,102,241,0.2), rgba(79,70,229,0.1)); border-color: rgba(99,102,241,0.3) !important; text-align: center; }
        .converter-cta p { color: var(--gray); font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
        .cta-btn { display: inline-block; background: var(--primary); color: white; text-decoration: none; padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem; border-radius: 0.5rem; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.9rem; transition: background 0.3s; width: 100%; text-align: center; }
        .cta-btn:hover { background: var(--primary-dark); }
        .related-list { list-style: none; }
        .related-list li { padding: 0.4rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); }
        .related-list li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
        .related-list a { color: var(--gray); text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.875rem; transition: color 0.2s; line-height: 1.4; display: block; }
        .related-list a:hover { color: var(--primary); }

        /* Footer */
        footer { padding: 3rem 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); margin-top: 3rem; }
        .footer-content { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; text-align: center; }
        .footer-logo { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--light); }
        .footer-links { display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; }
        .footer-links a { color: var(--gray); text-decoration: none; transition: color 0.3s; }
        .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--primary); }
        .footer-copyright { color: var(--gray); font-size: 0.9rem; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <header>
            <a href="/" class="logo">Rate<span>Flow</span></a>
            <nav>
                <a href="/">Converter</a>
                <a href="/blog">Blog</a>
                <a href="/about">About</a>
            </nav>
        </header>

        <main>
            <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
                <a href="/">Home</a>
                <span>›</span>
                <a href="/blog">Blog</a>
                <span>›</span>
                <span style="color: var(--light);"><%= post.title %></span>
            </nav>

            <div class="article-layout">
                <article>
                    <span class="article-category"><%= post.category %></span>
                    <h1><%= post.title %></h1>
                    <div class="article-meta">
                        <span>By RateFlow Team</span>
                        <span><%= new Date(post.date).toLocaleDateString('en-US', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' }) %></span>
                        <span><%= post.readTime %></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="article-body">
                        <%- post.content %>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <aside class="sidebar">
                    <div class="sidebar-card converter-cta">
                        <h3>Try the Live Converter</h3>
                        <p>Get real-time <%= post.converterFrom %> to <%= post.converterTo %> rates instantly — free, accurate, no ads.</p>
                        <a href="<%= post.converterLink %>" class="cta-btn">Convert <%= post.converterFrom %> → <%= post.converterTo %></a>
                    </div>

                    <div class="sidebar-card">
                        <h3>Popular Converters</h3>
                        <ul class="related-list">
                            <li><a href="/convert/usd-to-eur">USD to EUR – Dollar to Euro</a></li>
                            <li><a href="/convert/gbp-to-usd">GBP to USD – Pound to Dollar</a></li>
                            <li><a href="/convert/aed-to-usd">AED to USD – Dirham to Dollar</a></li>
                            <li><a href="/convert/eur-to-usd">EUR to USD – Euro to Dollar</a></li>
                            <li><a href="/convert/aud-to-usd">AUD to USD – Australian Dollar</a></li>
                            <li><a href="/convert/usd-to-inr">USD to INR – Dollar to Rupee</a></li>
                            <li><a href="/convert/cad-to-usd">CAD to USD – Canadian Dollar</a></li>
                            <li><a href="/currencies">All currencies →</a></li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <div class="sidebar-card">
                        <h3>More Guides</h3>
                        <ul class="related-list">
                            <li><a href="/blog/usd-to-eur-guide">What Moves the Dollar–Euro Rate</a></li>
                            <li><a href="/blog/gbp-to-usd-guide">Why GBP/USD Is Called "Cable"</a></li>
                            <li><a href="/blog/aed-to-usd-guide">Why the Dirham Is Pegged to the Dollar</a></li>
                            <li><a href="/blog/why-exchange-rates-change">Why Exchange Rates Change</a></li>
                            <li><a href="/blog/best-currency-converter-2025">Best Currency Converters 2025</a></li>
                            <li><a href="/blog/how-to-get-best-exchange-rate">Get the Best Exchange Rate</a></li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </aside>
            </div>
        </main>

        <footer>
            <div class="footer-content">
                <div class="footer-logo">RateFlow</div>
                <div class="footer-links">
                    <a href="/">Converter</a>
                    <a href="/blog">Blog</a>
                    <a href="/about">About</a>
                    <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>
                    <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
                </div>
                <div class="footer-copyright">&copy; <%= year %> RateFlow. All rights reserved.</div>
            </div>
        </footer>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
